 kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu","userPreferred":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu"}},"relationType":"PARENT","resolved":true},{"ids":{"anilist":118370,"mal":133167},"kind":"MANGA","mediaKey":null,"name":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu: Hyouketsu no Kizuna","node":{"countryOfOrigin":"JP","description":null,"episodes":null,"format":"MANGA","id":118370,"idMal":133167,"isAdult":false,"poster":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/bx118370-dKB1DHyWsbAy.jpg","title":{"english":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-, The Frozen Bond","native":"Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活 氷結の絆","romaji":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu: Hyouketsu no Kizuna","userPreferred":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu: Hyouketsu no Kizuna"}},"relationType":"ALTERNATIVE","resolved":false}],"schemaVersion":"1.1.0","score":{"scale":100,"source":"anilist","value":76},"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2018,"series":["al-100049"],"seriesIds":[100049],"startDate":{"day":6,"month":10,"year":2018},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"animation":true,"id":314,"name":"WHITE FOX"},{"animation":false,"id":238,"name":"AT-X"},{"animation":false,"id":16,"name":"TV Tokyo"},{"animation":false,"id":113,"name":"Kadokawa Shoten"},{"animation":false,"id":647,"name":"Memory-Tech"},{"animation":false,"id":777,"name":"Hakuhodo DY Music & Pictures"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Episode 1 - Memory Snow\n\nSubaru Natsuki finally gets to take a breather, but he does not waste any time as he prepares for a date with his beloved Emilia. He scouts the nearby village for the right dating spot, and with the help of the village children, he finds a wonderful location. With that, he is well prepared for his date!\n\nUnfortunately for Subaru, cold weather suddenly sweeps across Roswaal's mansion on his important day, leaving him with no choice but to postpone the date. Overnight, it becomes even colder and unbearable. Subaru must get to the bottom of this because, at this rate, his date will be the least of his worries.\n\nEpisode 2 - The Frozen Bond\n\nCovered in ice and snow, Elior Forest is the home to dangerous magical beasts and 50 elves frozen in ice. One day, the great spirit Puck helps a young girl break out of her ice prison. Her name is Emilia, a half-elf born with silver hair, long ears, and amethyst eyes—features that resemble the evil Witch who destroyed half the world long ago.\n\nShunned by society because of her appearance, Emilia dwells in the forest with Puck as her sole companion and family. Burdened with a sin of destruction she does not remember committing, she spends her days trying to find a way to help her frozen kin. But when the great spirit Melakuera, the Arbitrator of the world, finds Emilia, her right to stay alive is brought into question. Will the bonds of ice she formed with Puck prove to be the warm thread that defies fate?"},"tags":[{"name":"Isekai","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Elf","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Witch","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":63,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shapeshifting","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Snowscape","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Twins","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Maids","rank":45,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":42,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":35,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Monster Girl","rank":34,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- OVAs","english":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- OVAs","native":"Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活 OVAs","romaji":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu OVAs","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"Re:ゼロから始める異世界